    {
      "id": "fix-edited-node-hint",
      "text": "Implemented fix: remote edit hint\nWhen an agent or external resource sync creates, changes, or moves a node, show a subtle temporary color or glow until the user's pointer moves over it. Local edits, drags, undo, and redo do not add the hint; the state stays out of Graph context.",
      "tags": [
        "editor",
        "implemented"
      ],
      "layout": {
        "position": {
          "x": 1005.3836007342154,
          "y": 673.2704990822306
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fix-multi-select-delete",
      "text": "Planned fix: multi-select deletion\nNode context-menu Delete should remove every currently selected node, not only the node that opened the menu; preserve selection cleanup and undo behavior.",
      "tags": [
        "editor",
        "implemented",
        "planned"
      ],
      "layout": {
        "position": {
          "x": 640,
          "y": 680
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fix-remove-editor-toolbar",
      "text": "Implemented fix: remove editor action bar\nThe top action bar is gone and right-click menus are unchanged. Standard shortcuts: Ctrl+Z undo, Ctrl+Shift+Z redo, Ctrl+S save, Ctrl+R reload. Add node, Fit view, Delete, and export remain available through the command infrastructure and context actions.",
      "tags": [
        "editor",
        "implemented"
      ],
      "layout": {
        "position": {
          "x": 1385.3940585575629,
          "y": 719.7472220900985
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fix-resource-selector-stale",
      "text": "Planned fix: stable resource selector\nHovering another resource must not change the active graph. Only an explicit selection should switch resources; keep the selector and loaded graph synchronized so it cannot snap to the first graph or claim it is already active.",
      "tags": [
        "controller",
        "data",
        "planned"
      ],
      "layout": {
        "position": {
          "x": 302,
          "y": 662
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "react-flow-editor",
      "text": "React Flow editor\nEdits text nodes, free-form tags and colors, explicit four-side connections, filters, selection/inspector, undo/redo, export, and edge routing.",
      "tags": [
        "editor",
